{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44979","headline":"酬邢端公济春日苏台有呈袁州李使君兼书幷寄辛阳王三侍御 · 皎然","name":"酬邢端公济春日苏台有呈袁州李使君兼书幷寄辛阳王三侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大贤当佐世，尧时难退身。\n如何丹霄侣，却在沧江滨。\n柳色变又徧，莺声闻亦频。\n赖逢宜春守，共赏南湖春。\n营道知止足，饰躬无缁磷。\n家将诗流近，迹与禅僧亲。\n放旷临海门，翺翔望云津。\n虽高空王说，不久山中人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}